    # For each M, compute the number of connected bipartite graphs with partitions of size N/2 and N/2, and exactly M edges.
    
    # The total number of bipartite graphs (connected or not) with partitions of size N/2 and N/2 and exactly M edges is equal to the number of ways to choose M edges between the two partitions.
